{"id":"ele","lemma":"еле","pos":"adv","rank":2676,"glosses":["hardly, scarcely, barely","slightly","with (great) difficulty"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f4/Ru-%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я еле иду.","en":"I can hardly walk.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"идти"}]},{"text":"Они еле-еле что-то видели.","en":"They could hardly see.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"}]},{"text":"Я тебя еле слышу.","en":"I can barely hear you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"to hear","l":"слышать"}]},{"text":"Я еле переставлял ноги.","en":"I could hardly move my legs.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"leg","l":"нога"}]},{"text":"Мне это еле удалось.","en":"I barely managed to do that.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,null]}]}